Break into the debugger on an ILLEGAL instruction executed outside ROM.

In op_illg(), opcode 0x4AFC (ILLEGAL) with inrom == 0 steps past the
instruction and calls activate_debugger(), letting guest code trigger a
debugger break by planting an ILLEGAL opcode.

Index: demoscene-toolchain/submodules/amiberry/src/newcpu.cpp
===================================================================
--- demoscene-toolchain.orig/submodules/amiberry/src/newcpu.cpp
+++ demoscene-toolchain/submodules/amiberry/src/newcpu.cpp
@@ -3885,6 +3885,14 @@ uae_u32 REGPARAM2 op_illg (uae_u32 opcod
 		}
 	}
 
+	/* Break into debugger on ILLEGAL instruction placed outside of ROM. */
+	if (opcode == 0x4AFC && !inrom) {
+		m68k_incpc_normal (2);
+		fill_prefetch ();
+		activate_debugger ();
+		return 4;
+	}
+
 #ifdef AUTOCONFIG
 	if (opcode == 0xFF0D && inrt) {
 		/* User-mode STOP replacement */
